---
layout: base.njk
pageKey: book
permalink: book.html
protoNote: "This form is not connected; the real one would be Cal.com + Stripe."
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>{{ pages.book.heading }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ pages.book.intro }}</p>
    <ul class="meta">
      <li>{{ site.days }}</li>
      <li>{{ site.hours }}</li>
      <li>{{ site.location }}</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div>
        <div class="video" style="aspect-ratio:4/3">
          <div class="play">&#128197;</div>
          <b>Booking calendar</b>
          <small>Cal.com embed goes here &mdash; real availability, synced to his calendar, payment taken at booking via Stripe.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem">What happens next</h2>
        <p>You pick a time and pay the {{ lessons.first.price }}. You&rsquo;ll get a confirmation with the address, where to park, and a note saying you don&rsquo;t need to prepare anything &mdash; because you don&rsquo;t.</p>
        <p>I&rsquo;ll send a reminder the day before.</p>
        <p>Then you turn up, we have a play, and we work out what you&rsquo;re after. That&rsquo;s the whole thing.</p>
        <div class="highlight" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
          <p style="margin:0"><strong>Haven&rsquo;t played in twenty years?</strong> That&rsquo;s most of my students. You&rsquo;re not going to surprise me.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Or send me the details and I&rsquo;ll come back to you</h2>
    <p class="lede">If you&rsquo;d rather ask something first, that&rsquo;s completely normal. Nothing here is a difficult question.</p>
    <form class="book" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();this.querySelector('.done').hidden=false;">
      <label>Your name
        <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
      </label>
      <label>Email
        <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
      </label>
      <label>Phone
        <span class="hint">Optional, but a text is usually quicker than an email.</span>
        <input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel">
      </label>
      <label>Who are the lessons for?
        <select name="who">
          <option>Me &mdash; adult beginner</option>
          <option>Me &mdash; played before, want to get back into it</option>
          <option>Me &mdash; I play already, want jazz / harmony / improvisation</option>
          <option>My child</option>
          <option>My teenager</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Have you played before?
        <span class="hint">Roughly is fine. &ldquo;A bit at school, thirty years ago&rdquo; is a perfectly good answer.</span>
        <textarea name="experience"></textarea>
      </label>
      <label>Anything you&rsquo;d love to be able to play?
        <span class="hint">A song, a style, or just &ldquo;no idea yet&rdquo;.</span>
        <textarea name="goal"></textarea>
      </label>
      <label>Do you have a piano or keyboard at home?
        <select name="instrument">
          <option>Yes &mdash; an acoustic piano</option>
          <option>Yes &mdash; a digital piano or keyboard</option>
          <option>No, not yet</option>
          <option>Not sure if what I have is any good</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>How did you hear about me?
        <input type="text" name="source">
      </label>
      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:.5rem">
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Send it</button>
      </div>
      <p class="done reassure" hidden style="color:var(--accent-ink);font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Thanks &mdash; that would have sent in the real thing. (Prototype form.)</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>Other ways to reach me</h2>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Text me</h3>
        <p><strong>{{ site.phone }}</strong></p>
        <p>Genuinely the easiest option, and plenty of people prefer it. I&rsquo;ll usually reply the same day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Where I am</h3>
        <p><strong>{{ site.location }}, VIC</strong></p>
        <p>Full address comes with your booking confirmation. Street parking is easy, and it&rsquo;s a short walk from the tram.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
